      ":question/problem": "Which of the following matrices have a rank of $3?$\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 & 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 2 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 4 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,C=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 1 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$",
